# Baseline security headers for static assets (Cloudflare Workers static assets).
# The full Content-Security-Policy allowlist arrives in Phase 17 (SPEC section 18).
# Note: _headers does not apply to on-demand (Worker-rendered) responses; those
# set headers in Astro middleware.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), fullscreen=(self)
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
